{
  "source": "Prompts/big-upside-v8.mp4",
  "duration": 199.5733125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.86,
      "text": "When we talk about artificial intelligence, it helps to think of it as a giant calculator,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.42,
      "end": 7.38,
      "text": "running math at a scale nobody can picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.04,
      "end": 10.68,
      "text": "But that calculator can do some amazing things."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.2,
      "end": 15.38,
      "text": "Recently, it helps solve a problem that challenged scientists for 50 years."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.22,
      "end": 18.62,
      "text": "Inside your body, proteins act like tiny machines."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.44,
      "end": 23.04,
      "text": "They carry oxygen, fight infections, and perform countless other jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.76,
      "end": 29.02,
      "text": "A protein's shape helps determine what it does, but figuring out those exact shapes was"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.02,
      "end": 30.1,
      "text": "incredibly difficult."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.82,
      "end": 33.6,
      "text": "Then, an AI system called AlphaFold was introduced."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.6,
      "end": 39.22,
      "text": "Through decades of experiments, scientists had determined about 200,000 protein structures."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.24,
      "end": 44.56,
      "text": "AlphaFold predicted over 200 million protein structures, shared free."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.5,
      "end": 49.52,
      "text": "Those millions of predictions give researchers around the world an immediate advantage."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.16,
      "end": 54.22,
      "text": "They now have a clear starting point for studying complex diseases and developing new medicines."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.88,
      "end": 57.32,
      "text": "Who actually helped make that scale possible?"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.9,
      "end": 61.94,
      "text": "To answer that, we look to the co-founder of DeepMind, Demis Hasavas."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.54,
      "end": 67.66,
      "text": "Hasavas became a chess master at 13 and helped design the video game Theme Park at 17."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.38,
      "end": 72.42,
      "text": "From there, he went on to study the brain and co-found the AI Lab DeepMind."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.98,
      "end": 77.36,
      "text": "His team developed AlphaFold and chose to share its structure predictions completely free."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.1,
      "end": 81.2,
      "text": "A kid who loved games helps solve a 50-year science problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.84,
      "end": 86.94,
      "text": "More than 3 million people across over 190 countries have used those AlphaFold models."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.92,
      "end": 91.66,
      "text": "That work led to Hasavas sharing the 2024 Nobel Prize in chemistry."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.6,
      "end": 94.36,
      "text": "When he won, he explained his motivation."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.36,
      "end": 99.12,
      "text": "I've dedicated my career to advancing AI because of its unparalleled potential"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.12,
      "end": 101.3,
      "text": "to improve the lives of billions of people."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.94,
      "end": 105.18,
      "text": "The benefits also extend out of the lab and into daily routines,"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.32,
      "end": 107.56,
      "text": "starting on the left with finding cancer."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.38,
      "end": 110.5,
      "text": "Doctors examined breast scans for signs of disease."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.1,
      "end": 113.88,
      "text": "In a Swedish trial with over 100,000 women,"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.28,
      "end": 117.32,
      "text": "doctors using AI found more cancers than those without it."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.92,
      "end": 120.94,
      "text": "The doctor evaluates the scan and decides what care is needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.6,
      "end": 122.9,
      "text": "Look at the Reading Allowed section."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.64,
      "end": 126.94,
      "text": "A menu or food label presents a distinct challenge for blind people."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.6,
      "end": 131.7,
      "text": "Today, AI tools on a phone can read the text aloud and describe photos,"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.04,
      "end": 133.2,
      "text": "helping with everyday tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.72,
      "end": 134.46,
      "text": "We have flood warnings."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.26,
      "end": 138.18,
      "text": "These warnings give people critical time to prepare and move to safety."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.9,
      "end": 141.36,
      "text": "AI helps provide free warnings days ahead,"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.68,
      "end": 144.4,
      "text": "including places without equipment that measures river levels."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.02,
      "end": 147.16,
      "text": "These aren't abstract concepts for tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.16,
      "end": 151.6,
      "text": "As the board states, the upside is already reaching people."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.24,
      "end": 153.44,
      "text": "Every one of those is true."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.14,
      "end": 156.04,
      "text": "So the next time someone asks you,"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.46,
      "end": 158.26,
      "text": "what good does AI do for society?"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.14,
      "end": 159.96,
      "text": "You have an answer ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.98,
      "end": 164.88,
      "text": "For starters, AI is accelerating work that protects and improves lives."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.6,
      "end": 168.62,
      "text": "That brings us back to one more thing about Demisasovis."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.12,
      "end": 170.82,
      "text": "His story doesn't begin in a lab."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.44,
      "end": 174.36,
      "text": "It starts with a kid who loved chess and video games."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.98,
      "end": 176.22,
      "text": "That level of brilliance is rare,"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.74,
      "end": 179.78,
      "text": "but the attitude is a choice that you can make starting today."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.56,
      "end": 182.08,
      "text": "Whatever you happen to be good at,"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.08,
      "end": 183.82,
      "text": "point it at something that helps people."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.46,
      "end": 185.88,
      "text": "You might not win the Nobel Prize,"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.24,
      "end": 187.86,
      "text": "but who are we to say you won't?"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.52,
      "end": 190.14,
      "text": "The big upside is happening today."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.8,
      "end": 194.22,
      "text": "AI is already accelerating work that protects and improves lives."
    }
  ],
